      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "For a more structured lacy texture, try the shell stitch blanket. For a denser fabric, the granny stripe blanket uses treble clusters with no open gaps."
          }
        ]
